Package: libxfce4ui-2-0
Version: @DEB_LIBXFCE4UI_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4ui/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libxfce4util7, xfconf, libstartup-notification0, libepoxy0
